                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab774bef-5626-3da9-92cf-6ad7ee8f1ec2",
                        "entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного наблюдательный; способность замечать детали"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bdc9b35-71da-4364-9154-94bf499f59eb",
                                "sense_id": "ab774bef-5626-3da9-92cf-6ad7ee8f1ec2",
                                "text": "Самохвальство и самоуверенность американцев, их ханжество и лицемерие, продажность и преклонение перед долларом — ничто не ускользнуло от его наблюдательности; холодное равнодушие к положению заключенных в тюрьмах, узкая партийность народных представителей в законодательных собраниях, низкий уровень журналистики и особенно рабство, — рабство как язва, разъедающая весь организм Штатов, — всё нашло в нем неподкупного обличителя."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b6728ee-77bb-3037-9408-72a292240fcb",
                        "entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0afa4adf-37fd-3595-878f-18318b471bac",
                        "entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "психол."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a50a75f2-37a6-47ab-8c06-9e62f43c17b7",
                        "source_entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "target_lang_word": "power of observation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f4c2be04-efd4-40da-a913-82cf9a6bac3d",
                        "source_entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "target_lang_word": "outsight",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "outsight",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c988760a-105d-3339-bd62-ddc8c61bbf21",
                                        "entry_id": "5918806f-78bf-3577-9b66-459f48a254f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sight for that which is on the outside; the ability or capacity to perceive or anticipate external things; view; outlook; perspective; power of observation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65e94663-a8f3-4971-b131-1fb09d5ea1a0",
                                                "sense_id": "c988760a-105d-3339-bd62-ddc8c61bbf21",
                                                "text": "When we live by outsight, we become submissive to fate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b06adb2c-a01e-409b-bc88-832650a69482",
                                                "sense_id": "c988760a-105d-3339-bd62-ddc8c61bbf21",
                                                "text": "It can key her into broad areas of emotional import, and therefore of personal significance, which if made relevant to the subject matter would provide some children with opportunities for linking insights to outsights, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79021610-4b2d-4753-b204-d4c0ca79ac15",
                                                "sense_id": "c988760a-105d-3339-bd62-ddc8c61bbf21",
                                                "text": "This means honing their “outsight” —the capacity to perceive external things—and helping their constituents develop that ability as well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfcc0c46-667a-3318-8448-9847faf7f151",
                                        "entry_id": "5918806f-78bf-3577-9b66-459f48a254f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Expectation; prospect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef7a4732-a714-4543-8acd-c6958427f871",
                                                "sense_id": "bfcc0c46-667a-3318-8448-9847faf7f151",
                                                "text": "Yet we sail toward it grasping The outsight which we know is there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7764522d-dd3d-366b-a4b1-7e290f3eb188",
                                        "entry_id": "5918806f-78bf-3577-9b66-459f48a254f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Movable goods kept out of doors, such as animals, ploughs, carts, and other implements of husbandry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d387a90-4098-4bb8-bd5b-529f2ddffb6b",
                        "source_entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "target_lang_word": "espíritu de observación",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c65790b-d1b0-4021-9bb8-16587620f627",
                        "source_entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "target_lang_word": "spirito di osservazione",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a592c93-fa01-4f3b-86ca-3b38be645dd2",
                        "source_entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "target_lang_word": "capacita di osservazione",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "51965e3a-7fc9-43fa-8fb5-f17d4452c0e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "target_lang_word": "Beobachtungsgabe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Beobachtungsgabe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34b7d05b-157f-3dce-9d65-eeeaefb0e1ea",
                                        "entry_id": "9cec4593-3b3b-33a4-8f60-03a5292dfdd8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fähigkeit, etwas erfolgreich zu beobachten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "985b2711-fd1e-4893-a957-9d2f3c97448e",
                                                "sense_id": "34b7d05b-157f-3dce-9d65-eeeaefb0e1ea",
                                                "text": "„Seine scharfe Beobachtungsgabe und sein fast noch schärferer Intellekt machen nicht mehr vor der eigenen Person halt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba3356cf-0010-4ef4-bcec-df98f9430e0e",
                                                "sense_id": "34b7d05b-157f-3dce-9d65-eeeaefb0e1ea",
                                                "text": "„Und diese Tränen, deren Ursache die kleine Fürstin nicht begriff, liess sie unruhig werden, so wenig Beobachtungs- und Auffassungsgabe sie sonst auch hatte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9575c33-eea0-4c33-a46a-ec053096d38f",
                        "source_entry_id": "68d15740-35a4-30f7-9f52-336787bfd88d",
                        "target_lang_word": "Aufmerksamkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Aufmerksamkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8db6e1cb-2949-3547-93da-ff5f4a973a5d",
                                        "entry_id": "8b2e18a7-94a3-367e-90c1-7f1ec99db509",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "gezielte Wahrnehmung der Umwelt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "no-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d217901-ce2f-43e9-8cf3-f288575de3d5",
                                                "sense_id": "8db6e1cb-2949-3547-93da-ff5f4a973a5d",
                                                "text": "Nach ein paar Stunden Vortrag ließ seine Aufmerksamkeit nach."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4454d045-1e7b-4497-9606-370d1dff9800",
                                                "sense_id": "8db6e1cb-2949-3547-93da-ff5f4a973a5d",
                                                "text": "„In die St.-Kamillus-Kirche gingen auch unverheiratete Mädchen, in der Hoffnung, die Aufmerksamkeit eines wohlhabenden Junggesellen auf sich zu ziehen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "066957ee-c0f1-46f1-a57d-1f821783be47",
                                                "sense_id": "8db6e1cb-2949-3547-93da-ff5f4a973a5d",
                                                "text": "„Das hatte Aufmerksamkeit erregt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "527d1c8f-a04c-42fe-bf5a-586fe9458b05",
                                                "sense_id": "8db6e1cb-2949-3547-93da-ff5f4a973a5d",
                                                "text": "„Die brennenden Regenwälder des Amazonas […] haben weltweit enorme Aufmerksamkeit erregt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "255c689a-008e-4004-a518-80ee67d10af5",
                                                "sense_id": "8db6e1cb-2949-3547-93da-ff5f4a973a5d",
                                                "text": "„Der britische Autor Samuel Johnson hat das im 18. Jahrhundert schön formuliert: »Glaubt mir, Sir, wenn ein Mann weiß, dass er in zwei Wochen gehängt wird, schärft das seine Aufmerksamkeit ungemein.«“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a787db0-af30-4477-8620-6738006eb1d4",
                                                "sense_id": "8db6e1cb-2949-3547-93da-ff5f4a973a5d",
                                                "text": "„Ziel von Challenges ist Aufmerksamkeit, die von Mutproben Überwindung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ef97fa4-3aa2-384f-8a11-7f02a6c73ccb",
                                        "entry_id": "8b2e18a7-94a3-367e-90c1-7f1ec99db509",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kleines Geschenk, das jemandem bei einem Zusammentreffen übergeben wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6063646a-201b-4d89-a963-0e97b31d3319",
                                                "sense_id": "7ef97fa4-3aa2-384f-8a11-7f02a6c73ccb",
                                                "text": "Als kleine Aufmerksamkeit brachte er ihr eine Schachtel Pralinen mit."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
